JA4 (TLS fingerprinting) — BSD 3-Clause
---------------------------------------

Weirvern uses JA4, the TLS client fingerprint, from the `ja4-zeek-scripts`
project. The module is **vendored** into this repository at
`zeek/vendor/ja4-zeek-scripts/` and COPYed into the sensor image at build time.

JA4 is licensed under BSD 3-Clause; the copyright notice and license text travel
with the module (`zeek/vendor/ja4-zeek-scripts/LICENSE-JA4`), as the license
requires. BSD 3-Clause is free for any use, including commercial.

Nothing else from the upstream fingerprinting project is present in this
repository or in the sensor image. If you maintain a fork and add any other
fingerprinting method, review its license first: the upstream project's other
methods carry different terms that are not permissive for commercial use.

